## micro Wake Word

ESPHome implements an on-device wake word detection framework from [microWakeWord](https://github.com/kahrendt/microWakeWord).
See the [component documentation](/components/micro_wake_word) for details on how to use it.

Check out the live stream replay below for more details about how it works and came to be.

